#: includes/settings.php:129
msgid "General"
msgstr "General"

#: includes/settings.php:136
msgid "API Mode"
msgstr "Modo API"

#: includes/settings.php:142
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Select the API Mode. Use Self-hosted for the built-in WordPress REST API, or "
"Custom to point to your own ALTCHA-compatible backend."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el modo API. Usa Autoalojado para la API REST integrada de "
"WordPress, o Personalizado para apuntar a tu propio backend compatible con "
"ALTCHA."

#: includes/settings.php:144
msgid "Self-hosted"
msgstr "Autoalojado"

#: includes/settings.php:154
msgid "Challenge URL"
msgstr "URL del desafío"

#: includes/settings.php:162
msgid ""
"Only available when API Mode is set to Custom.<br/>The URL is made up of the "
"domain and path to your <strong>custom ALTCHA-compatible backend</strong>, "
"and optionally an API key (it starts with <code>gk_</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Solo disponible cuando el modo API está establecido como Personalizado.<br/>"
"La URL se compone del dominio y ruta a tu <strong>backend personalizado "
"compatible con ALTCHA</strong>, y opcionalmente una clave API (comienza "
"con <code>gk_</code>)."

#: includes/settings.php:171
msgid "Shared secret"
msgstr "Secreto compartido"

#: includes/settings.php:177
msgid "A secret key used to sign and verify challenges."
msgstr "Una clave secreta utilizada para firmar y verificar desafíos."

#: includes/settings.php:178
msgid ""
"OpenPorte generates a random secret automatically. Change it only if another "
"application needs to use the same secret.<br/>In Custom API Mode, this value "
"<strong>must exactly match</strong> the shared secret (sometimes called the "
"HMAC secret) configured in your backend."
msgstr ""
"OpenPorte genera un secreto aleatorio automáticamente. Cámbialo solo si "
"otra aplicación necesita usar el mismo secreto.<br/>En el modo API "
"Personalizado, este valor <strong>debe coincidir exactamente</strong> con el "
"secreto compartido (a veces llamado secreto HMAC) configurado en tu backend."

#: includes/settings.php:186 includes/settings.php:192
msgid "Hash algorithm for the challenges."
msgstr "Algoritmo de hash para los desafíos."

#: includes/settings.php:186
msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritmo"

#: includes/settings.php:193
msgid ""
"In Self-hosted API Mode this is the algorithm used to generate and verify "
"the proof-of-work challenges.<br/>In Custom API Mode it must match the "
"algorithm your backend uses — most ALTCHA-compatible backends default to "
"SHA-256."
msgstr ""
"En el modo API Autoalojado, este es el algoritmo utilizado para generar y "
"verificar los desafíos proof-of-work.<br/>En el modo API Personalizado, "
"debe coincidir con el algoritmo que usa tu backend: la mayoría de los "
"backends compatibles con ALTCHA usan SHA-256 por defecto."

#: includes/settings.php:203
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Baja"

#: includes/settings.php:204
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Media"

#: includes/settings.php:205
msgid "High"
msgstr "Alta"

#: includes/settings.php:215
msgid "Complexity"
msgstr "Complejidad"

#: includes/settings.php:221
msgid ""
"Select the PoW complexity for the widget: the higher the complexity, the "
"longer visitors (and bots) work to solve the challenge.<br/>Even High is "
"usually solved in under a second on a recent computer; on older phones it "
"can take a few seconds. High is roughly 2–3× the work of Low."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la complejidad PoW para el widget: cuanto mayor sea la "
"complejidad, más tiempo trabajarán los visitantes (y los bots) para "
"resolver el desafío.<br/>Incluso el nivel Alto suele resolverse en menos de "
"un segundo en un ordenador reciente; en móviles antiguos puede tardar "
"unos segundos. Alto es aproximadamente 2-3 veces el trabajo de Bajo."

#: includes/settings.php:228
msgid "Expiration"
msgstr "Expiración"

#: includes/settings.php:234
msgid ""
"Life-span of a challenge. Custom accepts 0 to 14400 seconds, where 0 means "
"no expiry (None) and 14400 is 4 hours."
msgstr ""
"Duración de un desafío. Personalizado acepta de 0 a 14400 segundos, "
"donde 0 significa sin expiración (Ninguna) y 14400 son 4 horas."

#: includes/settings.php:243
msgid "Widget Customisation"
msgstr "Personalización del widget"

#: includes/settings.php:250
msgid "Auto verification"
msgstr "Verificación automática"

#: includes/settings.php:256
msgid "Select auto-verification behaviour."
msgstr "Selecciona el comportamiento de verificación automática."

#: includes/settings.php:258
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Desactivado"

#: includes/settings.php:259
msgid "On page load"
msgstr "Al cargar la página"

#: includes/settings.php:260
msgid "On form focus"
msgstr "Al enfocar el formulario"

#: includes/settings.php:261
msgid "On form submit"
msgstr "Al enviar el formulario"

#: includes/settings.php:268
msgid "Display Mode"
msgstr "Modo de visualización"

#: includes/settings.php:274
msgid ""
"Choose whether the widget sits inline in the page or floats near the submit "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Elige si el widget se coloca en línea en la página o flota cerca del "
"botón de enviar."

#: includes/settings.php:276
msgid "Inline"
msgstr "En línea"

#: includes/settings.php:277
msgid "Floating"
msgstr "Flotante"

#: includes/settings.php:284
msgid "Verification Delay"
msgstr "Retraso de verificación"

#: includes/settings.php:293
msgid ""
"Some visitors perceive a slower check as more trustworthy, and that is this "
"pause's only effect. It does not make spam-blocking any stronger; to raise "
"the bar for bots, increase Complexity instead."
msgstr ""
"Algunos visitantes perciben una verificación más lenta como más "
"confiable, y ese es el único efecto de esta pausa. No hace que el "
"bloqueo de spam sea más fuerte; para aumentar la barrera para los bots, "
"aumenta la Complejidad en su lugar."

#. translators: %s is the added delay in seconds, e.g. "0.5"
#: includes/settings.php:296
#, php-format
msgid "Add %s second delay"
msgstr "Añadir un retraso de %s segundos"

#: includes/settings.php:304
msgid "Acknowledgement"
msgstr "Reconocimiento"

#: includes/settings.php:310
msgid ""
"This applies to the small ALTCHA logo shown inside the widget. ALTCHA is "
"free, open-source software — we would appreciate you keeping it visible, but "
"the choice is yours."
msgstr ""
"Esto se aplica al pequeño logotipo de ALTCHA mostrado dentro del widget. "
"ALTCHA es software libre y de código abierto: agradeceríamos que lo "
"mantuvieras visible, pero la decisión es tuya."

#: includes/settings.php:311
msgid "Hide the ALTCHA logo"
msgstr "Ocultar el logotipo de ALTCHA"

#: includes/settings.php:326
msgid ""
"This applies to the text shown inside the widget. Same as the logo: keeping "
"it visible helps credit the project this plugin is built on, but it has no "
"effect on how OpenPorte works."
msgstr ""
"Esto se aplica al texto mostrado dentro del widget. Igual que el "
"logotipo: mantenerlo visible ayuda a dar crédito al proyecto en el que "
"se basa este plugin, pero no tiene ningún efecto en el funcionamiento de "
"OpenPorte."

